# pr-431: gh-388 Paginate GitHub list tools (branches, PR reviews, open PRs, workflow run jobs)

## Description

Closes #388

- Sync (JS bridge): new `github_paged_sync_tools.dart` part with one shared walker `_walkPages` (array + `{total_count, key:[...]}` envelope); `github_get_commit_check_runs` now uses it too (old `_walkCheckRunPages` removed).
- `github_list_branches`, `github_list_pr_reviews`, `github_get_workflow_run_jobs` (merges `jobs`, keeps page-1 `total_count`) walk all pages.
- `github_list_prs`: `state=open` walks all pages; closed/merged keep first-page behaviour (documented in tool description); merged filter unchanged.
- MCP `GithubClient`: listBranches / listPrs(open) / listPullRequestReviews paginate identically (page-1 error propagates, later-page failure keeps collected pages).
- Semantics: per_page=100 from page=1; stop on short/empty page; page-1 error/non-JSON bodies pass through; short first page = one request, body unchanged.
- Tests: mocked HTTP only (fixture server + Dio adapter).

